Details for checks implementation:

- Load with yaml.compose for duplicates: 
```python
def dup_keys(path):
    node = yaml.compose(open(path,'rb').read())
    dups=[]
    def walk(n, chain):
        if isinstance(n, yaml.MappingNode):
            seen={}
            for k,v in n.value:
                ks = k.value if isinstance(k, yaml.ScalarNode) else None
                if ks in seen: dups.append((chain+[ks], ks, k.start_mark.line+1))
                else: seen[ks]=True
                walk(v, chain+[ks])
        elif isinstance(n, yaml.SequenceNode):
            for i,it in enumerate(n.value): walk(it, chain+[f'[{i}]'])
    walk(node, [])
    return dups
```
